{"product_id":"the-destiny-of-violet-luke","title":"The Destiny of Violet \u0026 Luke","description":"\u003cp\u003eLuke's life has always been about order, control, and acting tough on the outside. Meaningless relationships are a distraction-- a way to tune out the twisted memories of his childhood. Violet has had a rough life: the memory of her parent's unsolved murders; living in foster homes with drugs and neglect. When they meet they clash instantly, yet they can't seem to stay away from each other. They discover just how similar they are. But they also discover that the past always catches up with you ...\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jessica Sorensen\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781455576517\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 336\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 0 x 210\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41763046850713,"sku":"9RB9781455576517","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-destiny-of-violet-luke-196048.jpg?v=1694791869","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-destiny-of-violet-luke","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}